## Portfolio logo components

**`PortfolioCard`** — venture logo top-left, max-h-10, object-contain. Fallback: venture name in `font-heavy` if no logo.

**`VentureHero`** — venture logo larger (max-h-14 md:max-h-16). Client logos below summary via `ClientLogoStrip`.

**`ClientLogoStrip`** — horizontal wrap, uniform height `h-8 md:h-10`, `opacity-70 hover:opacity-100`, `grayscale` optional on parchment (remove on dark). Gap `gap-8 md:gap-12`. Each logo needs `alt` with client name.

Logo treatment: no drop shadows, no borders around logos, preserve aspect ratio, `object-contain`.

## Page templates (`src/layouts/`)

- `BaseLayout.astro` — SEO, fonts, Header, Footer
- `ArticleLayout.astro` — single column prose, author card, related essays
- `PathwayLayout.astro` — P1–P7 section sequence
- `AudienceLayout.astro` — A1–A7 section sequence
- `VentureLayout.astro` — case study + venture logo + client logo strip

## Composition rules

1. Pages are **arrays of sections** — no page-specific markup outside `src/pages/`
2. Pass copy as props or import from `src/data/copy/` generated from docs
3. Cards share one base: `border border-sand bg-parchment p-8 rounded-sm`
4. Dark sections alternate on long pages for rhythm
5. Every page ends with `ClosingCTA` or `PageCTA` except article pages (use essay CTA)

## Responsive patterns

- 5-card grids: `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3` (founders wraps to 2+3)
- 4-card grids: `grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2`
- Hero CTAs: `flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4`
- Nav: hamburger below `lg` breakpoint
